# =============================================================================
# PRIVACY-CRITICAL EXCLUSIONS — do not relax without ethics approval
# =============================================================================
# The study cohort is identifiable patient health information from a single
# clinical centre. The following must never be committed or archived.

# Re-identification keys. patient_key.csv maps pseudonyms to patient NAMES.
03_Data/Processed/private/
**/patient_key.csv
**/anonymization_crosswalk.csv

# Raw clinical extracts
03_Data/Raw/

# Analysed patient records (pseudonymised, not anonymised: patient_id resolves
# via the crosswalk above). Use the synthetic cohort instead — see README.
03_Data/Processed/real_*.csv
03_Data/Anonymized/
03_Data/Processed/clean_patient_covariates.csv
03_Data/Processed/longitudinal_missingness.csv
03_Data/Processed/data_cleaning_audit.csv
03_Data/Processed/stan_data_real*.rds

# =============================================================================
# Large or regenerable artefacts
# =============================================================================
# Posterior draws: hundreds of MB, regenerable by refitting
08_Model/**/*.csv
08_Model/**/*.rds
!08_Model/loo_gaussian_vs_studentt.csv

# Simulation checkpoints: thousands of files, regenerable
**/checkpoints/
**/checkpoints_*/
04_Code/threshold_crossing_model/outputs/**/*.rds
04_Code/threshold_crossing_model/outputs/*.rds

# Compiled Stan binaries and CmdStan build products
*.exe
*.o
*.hpp
04_Code/Stan/cmdstan/

# LaTeX build products
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.synctex
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.toc

# R / RStudio
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
